\"extiw\" title=\"w:Avocado\">Avocado</a> with its cross section. Pictured in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. App 18 cm (7 inches) long.\nAng avocado na nahahati sa dalawa na kinunan sa Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. Humahaba ng 18cm", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2009", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Muhammad_Mahdi_Karim\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:User:Muhammad Mahdi Karim\">Muhammad Mahdi Karim</a></b>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Permission": {"value": "I, the copyright holder of this work, hereby publish it under the following license:", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "GFDL 1.2", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "GNU Free Documentation License 1.2", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "http://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/fdl-1.2.html", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}}}]}, "122055047": {"pageid": 122055047, "ns": 6, "title": "File:First report on quality and purity evaluations of avocado oil sold in the US.pdf", "index": 3, "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf/page1-500px-First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 500, "thumbheight": 667, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf/page1-960px-First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf/page1-500px-First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 500, "height": 667, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf/page1-960px-First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:First_report_on_quality_and_purity_evaluations_of_avocado_oil_sold_in_the_US.pdf", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=122055047", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2022-08-19 22:15:41", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "First report on quality and purity evaluations of avocado oil sold in the US", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Olive oil|October 2020|Food testing|English-language PDF files", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "The demand for avocado oil has increased significantly as consumers resonate with its potential health benefits, however, due to the lack of enforceable standards, consumers are unprotected from fraud (i.e., economic motivated adulteration). This study analyzed avocado oils currently on the market in the US to evaluate their quality (e.g., free fatty acidity, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/food-science/peroxide-value\">peroxide value</a>, UV absorbances, vitamin E) and purity (e.g., fatty acids, sterols, triacylglycerols). Our results showed that the majority of commercial samples were oxidized before reaching the expiration date listed on the bottle. In addition, adulteration with soybean oil at levels near 100% was confirmed in two “extra virgin” and one “refined” sample. These findings demonstrate there is an urgent need to develop standards for avocado oil not only to ensure the consumers receive high quality and authentic products but to establish a level playing field to support the continuing growth of global avocado oil industry.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2020-10", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0956713520302449\">https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0956713520302449</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "Hilary S.Green and Selina C.Wang", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-4.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}}]}}}}